::PC_U06_L01_Q_Q01::
Question ID: PC_U06_L01_Q_Q01
MLA Standard: MLA.PC.SEQ.1
Question:
An arithmetic sequence has first term 4 and common difference 3. Which expression gives a_n?
{
~A. 4(3)^(n-1) #This choice uses a related idea but does not complete the required reasoning for the stated standard.
~B. 3+4(n-1) #This choice reflects a common misconception or an incomplete step.
~C. 4+3^n #This choice does not match the conditions in the question.
=D. 4+3(n-1) #Correct. This answer follows the lesson concept and connects the result to the stated standard.
}

